.SH NAME
le-qr - Show a LAN URL / QR to open a local port on your phone


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBle qr PORT [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Print this Mac's LAN URL for PORT — what to open on a phone on the same
network — and render a scannable QR when \fBqrencode\fR is installed. Uses the
LAN IP, because \fBlocalhost\fR on the phone points at the phone, not this Mac.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for qr


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBle(1)\fP


